null,{"className":"reading-section-en","children":"RESEARCH PROBLEM"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["研究问题",false]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"如何在缺少大规模人工推理标注时，训练模型生成有效的推理过程？"}]]}]]}],["$","section","insight",{"id":"insight","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",2]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-en","children":"INSIGHT"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["核心洞察",["$","small",null,{"children":"本站解读"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"STaR 利用答案监督筛选模型自己生成的推理，将原本缺少中间步骤的数据转化为训练材料。失败题可以借助正确答案再生成解释，使训练覆盖更多问题；关键机制是生成、验证与微调的循环，而不是把所有自生成文本都当作正确知识。"}]]}]]}],["$","section","observation",{"id":"observation","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",3]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-en","children":"OBSERVATION"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["关键观察",false]}],"$L10"]}]]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14"]}],"$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}],"$L19"]}]]}]
10:["$","p",null,{"children":"作者报告多个数据集上，迭代学习合格推理优于直接微调预测最终答案，并在 CommonsenseQA 上与更大模型的微调结果比较。方法仍使用正确答案和少量推理示例，结果支持自生成推理的训练价值，不能据此认定所有推理过程都正确。"}]
11:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",4]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-en","children":"METHOD"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["方法解析",false]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"生成推理、筛选正确结果；失败时提供正确答案尝试反推，再用合格推理微调并重复。"}]]}]]}]
